# VES public repo — the whole record (ruled 2026-09-01: there is no local seat).
# Only material that can never be made synthetic is kept out: client fixtures and vendor reference PDFs.
# Registers (LEDGER.md and any successor) are public and carry synthetic aliases only.

node_modules/
*.tmp
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# Client material — never public, no other home in this project.
# `fixtures/*` rather than `fixtures/`: git does not descend into an ignored DIRECTORY, so a
# negation inside one never fires. Ignoring the contents instead leaves the door open for the
# one subtree that must be tracked — the synthetic fixtures every probe and gate runs on.
fixtures/*
!fixtures/synthetic/
refs/

# Batch scratch clones and their patches — working copies, never the record
.scratch/

# Release artifacts stay out except the synthetic demo and its own README
release/*
!release/demo/
!release/README.md
